+| actions | clip ±100, scale 0.25 | same |
+| commands | vx, vy ∈ U(−1, 1), heading ∈ U(−3.14, 3.14), zeroed if ‖(vx, vy)‖ ≤ 0.2; resampled every 500 steps and on reset; yaw = clip(0.5·wrap(heading error), ±1) every step | same (env-side sampler; quadcontrol's command sampler disabled) |
+| rewards | 10 terms, scales × dt, total clipped at 0; `dof_acc` with policy dt; torques of last physics substep; air time on foot z-force > 1 N, `last_contacts` not cleared on reset; collision = thigh/calf bodies > 0.1 N; soft limits from URDF, rear thigh distinct | same |
+| termination | base contact > 1 N, \|pitch\| > 1.0, \|roll\| > 0.8, `episode_length_buf > 1000` | same |
